@host = http://localhost:5003

### Place a booking (seed an event + seatId via Inventory Service first, use a real seatId here)
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": 1,
  "seatId": 1,
  "userId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "amount": 49.99,
  "idempotencyKey": "demo-key-001"
}

### Expected right now: seat gets held successfully, then payment call fails
### (Payment Service doesn't exist yet) -> after retries + circuit breaker,
### booking compensates: seat is released, status ends as Cancelled.

### Get booking status (replace with the bookingId returned above)
GET {{host}}/api/bookings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Re-send the SAME idempotencyKey -> should return the original booking, not create a new one
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": 1,
  "seatId": 1,
  "userId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "amount": 49.99,
  "idempotencyKey": "demo-key-001"
}

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health
